  <entry>
    <title>html基础</title>
    <url>/2026/03/26/html%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h2 id="Html标题"><a href="#Html标题" class="headerlink" title="Html标题"></a>Html标题</h2><p>html标题是通过<code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>-<code>&lt;h6&gt;</code>标签来定义的。</p>
<figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h1</span>&gt;</span>这是一个一级标题<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h1</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span>这是一个二级标题<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span>这是一个三级标题<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="Html段落"><a href="#Html段落" class="headerlink" title="Html段落"></a>Html段落</h2><p>html段落是通过<code>&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</code>标签的来定义的。</p>
<figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span>这是一个段落<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="Html链接"><a href="#Html链接" class="headerlink" title="Html链接"></a>Html链接</h2><p>Html链接是通过标签<code>&lt;a&gt;</code>来定义的</p>
<figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;https://fengnian.wiki&quot;</span>&gt;</span>这是一个链接<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="Html图像"><a href="#Html图像" class="headerlink" title="Html图像"></a>Html图像</h2><p>Html图像是通过标签<code>&lt;img&gt;</code>来定义的。</p>
<figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">img</span> <span class="attr">src</span>=<span class="string">&quot;image/123.jpg&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>






]]></content>
      <categories>
        <category>Html日志</category>
      </categories>
      <tags>
        <tag>html</tag>
      </tags>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>html笔记-1</title>
    <url>/2026/03/25/html%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0-1/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>HTML 文档的基本结构关键字（标签）如下：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>标签</th>
<th>作用</th>
<th>详情</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</code></td>
<td>指定 HTML 文档的版本。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#doctype" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;html&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义整个 HTML 文档的根元素，包裹所有内容。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#html" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;head&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义文档的头部信息，包括标题、字符集、编码等。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#head" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;title&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义页面的标题。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#title" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;body&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义网页的主要内容区域。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#body" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;h1&gt;~&lt;h6&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义页面中不同级别的标题。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#headings" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义段落。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#p" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;ul&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义无序列表。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#ul" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;li&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义列表项。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#li" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;a&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义超链接。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#a" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义图片。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#img" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义容器。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#div" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;span&gt;</code></td>
<td>定义文本或行内元素。</td>
<td><a href="/glossary/#span" target="_blank">查看</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<!-- <a href="/glossary/#???" target="_blank">查看详情</a>用于关键字跳转 -->

<p>一个最简 HTML 结构示例：</p>
<figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class="keyword">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">html</span> <span class="attr">lang</span>=<span class="string">&quot;zh-CN&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">meta</span> <span class="attr">charset</span>=<span class="string">&quot;UTF-8&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">meta</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="string">&quot;viewport&quot;</span> <span class="attr">content</span>=<span class="string">&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">title</span>&gt;</span>页面标题<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">title</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">&lt;!-- 页面内容 --&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>这些是构成一个有效 HTML 文档的<strong>必备关键字</strong>。</p>
<h2 id="持续更新中…………"><a href="#持续更新中…………" class="headerlink" title="持续更新中…………"></a>持续更新中…………</h2>]]></content>
      <categories>
        <category>技术</category>
      </categories>
      <tags>
        <tag>html</tag>
      </tags>
